(Attention Mechanisms in Sequence Models) Tj T*
T*
(Abstract) Tj T*
(We introduce a sequence transduction architecture that dispenses with) Tj T*
(recurrence entirely and relies exclusively on a scaled dot-product) Tj T*
(attention operator. On the WMT 2014 English-to-German benchmark the) Tj T*
(model reaches 28.4 BLEU while training in a fraction of the time) Tj T*
(required by the recurrent baselines it replaces.) Tj T*
T*
(The central claim of this work is that alignment quality does not) Tj T*
(depend on sequential computation. Positional information enters the) Tj T*
(model through fixed sinusoidal encodings rather than through the) Tj T*
(order in which tokens are processed.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
