(Method) Tj T*
T*
(Each encoder layer applies multi-head attention followed by a) Tj T*
(position-wise feedforward network. Residual connections wrap both) Tj T*
(sublayers and layer normalisation is applied to the sum.) Tj T*
T*
(The scaled dot-product operator divides the logits by the square root) Tj T*
(of the key dimension. Without this rescaling the softmax saturates for) Tj T*
(large key dimensions and the resulting gradients become vanishingly) Tj T*
(small, which is the specific failure this normalisation prevents.) Tj T*
T*
(We train with the Adam optimiser and a warmup schedule that increases) Tj T*
(the learning rate linearly for the first four thousand steps, then) Tj T*
(decays it proportionally to the inverse square root of the step) Tj T*
(number. Label smoothing of 0.1 is applied throughout.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
